title: 'Typer: together as fallible expression — scope error union + From at site'
status: complete
atomic: true
priority: medium
blocked_by:
- 2-6-5-2
created_at: '2026-06-13T19:30:22'
updated_at: '2026-06-17T12:11:42'
result: 'together is a fallible expression: scope error union computed as the delta
  of the enclosing fn''s inferred error types over the child body (reusing the existing
  SCC/From inference), with From conversion applied at the child site (child dispatch
  body typed against the enclosing fn''s Result-err type). The boxed full Result-err
  value carries arbitrary payloads + converted error types correctly. Quaternary arms
  on together: `!!` binds err and handles in place (scope_err_handler_binds_err passes),
  `?` ok-arm allowed ($ is Unit), bare `!` rejected with a diagnostic. Fixed a real
  CFG bug: with both `?` and `!!` arms the error path fell through into the ok-arm
  (running both, with a null-ptr Branch ICE); restructured lower_together into a prop_bb/ok_bb/done_bb
  diamond so ok-arm runs only on a clean join and err-arm only on a failing child.
  DoD: scope_error_propagates_with_from passes; `!!` handler compiles and binds err.
  Added scope_quaternary_error_runs_only_err_arm and scope_quaternary_ok_runs_only_ok_arm.
  22 concurrency tests + full suite green, zero warnings.'
description: 'E3/E6: make the `together` block a fallible expression whose error union
  is the union of its child bodies'' error unions. Reuse the existing function error-inference
  machinery (SCC least-fixpoint, From graph from the locked error model). The scope
  participates in implicit propagation: with no handler a failing scope makes the
  enclosing function fallible and re-raises with From conversion (R1/R3 checked at
  the scope site). Support the multiline quaternary `!!` arm on a together block (E4):
  `together ... !! log(err)` binds `err` to the first error; `?` arm allowed ($ is
  Unit); `!` arm rejected as meaningless for scopes. If full SCC union proves too
  invasive, degrade cleanly: compute the union from directly-lexical child bodies
  and emit a diagnostic for the deferred cases. Depends on 2-6-5-2. DoD: scope_error_propagates_with_from
  passes; a `!!` handler on together compiles and binds err. Atomic.'
